an engineering IT firms)….so its already growing decent. I took data from google gemini to compare. Add to it the acquisition is at a great time when valuations of IT firms are compressed and happiest minds is AI focussed firm and complimentary, so I would say capital allocation is also excellent. They seem to be doing some right issue of ITC infotech to fund the deal… My only thought is around what would have…","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/itc-will-s-gold-flake-assist-ashirwad-to-win-bingo/29904/1676","sentiment":"neutral","likes":6,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T17:22:03.508Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-25T17:57:01.956Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650436","source":"valuepickr","author":"Investor_No_1","handle":"@Investor_No_1","community":"ITC: \"Will\"(s) \"Gold Flake\" assist \"Ashirwad\" to win \"Bingo!\"?","timestamp":"2026-09-01T12:02:58.690Z","text":"It looks like ITC infotech, unlike hotels, will not demerge & rather be listed via happiest minds….to be honest I had hoped for a demerger like hotels business being existing shareholder of ITC. Other than the business benefit of merging with happiest minds, I do not see any major value unlocking for ITC existing shareholder as anyhow standalone midcap IT firms trade around 20PE and ITC is around 18 PE. Plus there will be holding discount on listing…..demerger of cash flow rich IT business would have been better for existing shareholders… Above just my thought & I can be wrong in all my assess…","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/itc-will-s-gold-flake-assist-ashirwad-to-win-bingo/29904/1675","sentiment":"neutral","likes":2,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T17:22:03.508Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-25T17:57:01.956Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650435","source":"valuepickr","author":"devarshi84","handle":"@devarshi84","community":"ITC: \"Will\"(s) \"Gold Flake\" assist \"Ashirwad\" to win \"Bingo!\"?","timestamp":"2026-09-01T11:42:08.831Z","text":"https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/information-technology/happiest-minds-to-merge-with-itc-infotech-soota-led-promoter-group-to-sell-22-1-stake-for-over-rs-1300-cr-14019129.html bseindia.com a44fd90c-024a-4f9e-9976-666bd6983b23.pdf ITC Infotech has been the neglected child of the conglomerate for years. It does not even get a place in the presentation. surprisingly, Amalgamation of blazeclan and Happiest minds is good news. I, as an investor am not happy with Sanjiv Puri. The recent outperformance of the company was purely thanks to macro and sectoral tailwinds. the packaging and print…","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/itc-will-s-gold-flake-assist-ashirwad-to-win-bingo/29904/1674","sentiment":"bearish","likes":2,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T17:22:03.508Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-25T17:57:01.956Z"},{"id":"news-gn-T3JnM2hLRDRmaXNvN3pDa09wTnhUalc4","source":"news","author":"The Economic Times","handle":"The Economic Times","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-01T04:59:46.000Z","text":"ITC shares rise 5%; Happiest Minds falls 8% after FMCG major acquires IT firm. What shareholders must know","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T06:29:45.519Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-01T06:29:45.519Z"},{"id":"news-gn-eGRNQklVYlRLOXVBV0YwdFlTNUs4c0lB","source":"news","author":"Moneycontrol.com","handle":"Moneycontrol.com","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-01T04:31:55.000Z","text":"ITC shares jump nearly 3%, among top Nifty gainers after Happiest Minds-ITC Infotech merger deal","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T06:29:45.519Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-01T06:29:45.519Z"},{"id":"news-gn-FZWNjXzZpdm5lNW1RbHRsMC0xUW5LbVU","source":"news","author":"Livemint","handle":"Livemint","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-01T04:16:37.000Z","text":"Why ITC share price is down today? What's behind the stock plunge? Trigger and data details here","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentime